{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37037","headline":"句 · 罗隐","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夏窗七叶连阴暗。\n赖家桥上潏河边。\n细看月轮真有意，已知青桂近嫦娥。\n一个祢衡容不得，思量黄祖谩英雄。\n张华谩出如丹语，不及刘侯一纸书。\n山雨霏微宿上亭，雨中因想雨淋铃。\n老僧斋罢关门睡，不管波涛四面生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37037.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37037","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}